{"ID":"20240513083048-0n9uzhx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083048-0n9uzhx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083048-0n9uzhx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165148-79drll1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165148-79drll1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:453,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165148-79drll1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:660,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:660\u0026#125;","title":"260","type":"doc","updated":"20240513165148"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513165148-79drll1","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 657px;","id":"20240513165148-79drll1","updated":"20240513165148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：2008/03/31傳真問診"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"202 L, CYH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"71歲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/03/31"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎功能僅剩25%，胃不舒服，胃鏡結果發現有發炎和紅腫，全身無力，血壓高(180/100)。服用降血壓藥(高血壓35年)、抗憂鬱藥(憂鬱症20年)、降尿酸藥(痛風)、安眠藥和鎮靜劑。降血壓藥已經快失效。從三十年前起就無運動不喝水(因不口渴)也不流汗。曾有輸尿管結石。頭腦清楚但健忘。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診\n睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服安眠藥才能睡，夢多，每天都很累但睡不著。每天在腳抽筋中醒來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"會餓但吃不多。中等食量泡麵半包即飽(師：不可再吃泡麵！)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2~3天/次。大便如鞭，前硬後軟。黃色。未盡感。內痔三十年。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃。尿量中等。尿意有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非常口渴，但喝不下水，喝第二口水就覺得噁心嘔吐。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足溫度：\n掌額溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手掌心熱但腳底冷。雙手掌麻痠但不痛不冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完全不流汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"走幾步路即喘，無法爬樓梯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小腿和腳掌常感到麻，腳會水腫。因睡不好而頭痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾因腳水腫服利尿劑而導致心跳減慢送醫急救插管救回一命。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉紅無苔。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸二錢 細辛二錢 木通三錢 桂枝五錢 炙甘草五錢 白芍五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吳茱萸三錢 乾薑二錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤豆五錢 槐花三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉四錢 白朮五錢 茯苓四錢 生硫磺二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏四錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洋蔘三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡二錢 鬱金五錢 遠志三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九晚煮三晚 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-71六兩 抗憂鬱 30x2 午餐與睡覺前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、此人腎陽已幾無，顧溫陽利水已經不夠強，需用生硫磺使水直接氣化。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、當歸亦具有抗焦慮的作用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}